": "38347751224815589", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_38347751238148921_5057248519300288108_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L20z8su7HOYQ7kNvwG2bz_W&_nc_oc=Adoocob8SJWkOHIgLgw1fTMw8DXFnMWLFdbBYeB3QrFwlUjSrZ0yMunGtgPZGo8Xjtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE-P2fig7mWrtBaEJUyMV5Vszwy-HnDYM1RMKFfH4ktiA&oe=6A9409D7"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot2-lane_1.png", "id": "1344809297858874", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1344809301192207_4447666598631232526_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uFKy9lRjjjEQ7kNvwHrcbsg&_nc_oc=AdqM0Phxp9u_1rStL9tKF3CTvbCPGCU2802yGDuons2BQ-TvZAD2qBcSzNEkr1Yomhk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFvqZc8a4ic3QVQK4ZbhqTUo8NHhVLMa3Dncz644c9saQ&oe=6A9413CB"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot3-depth-alt_1.png", "id": "1040915801870464", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1040915808537130_4781429846582066514_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EeCZ0vm5pWgQ7kNvwFnQh9n&_nc_oc=AdqI047Jmgu2YFFkvrp9JjdXLUNUmPQoX1JBRhWbamJGIJ2rGeH4w7nXM-aflTet_FM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGSefPwlWLmOXdvFpqf7qYhn-EaVtdcPigut2FDipS6cA&oe=6A9414CE"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot4-score_1.png", "id": "27554383440855653", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624983_27554383447522319_1875656870862086556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zVT6iGLfAoYQ7kNvwGgNhOE&_nc_oc=AdrKHpaAgC7BIWzejff9ujXjC6kG-abPOylNtxyZRR6cnEvaX4JwsoUMC7tjHjpnf3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEyBeJ02ENywSgnjR7FLrVI0nhT4ipMi4qk2m1GDAvf1w&oe=6A93FDF6"}, {"file_name": "cap_shot5-rest_1.png", "id": "1706333930584924", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_1706333933918257_8714833817623575886_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ocRO_J44osQ7kNvwGtOGXf&_nc_oc=Adq-wSJy2JEOpLUmroriovdjyHwZ04OwREnaSfRCamydO8rDZRfrNvW9H3yY2IyK0JY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGeOqwSMEw8_vVELpMyvwlrA72IFS3fNirzJNiK-qC9UA&oe=6A9409D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "AxeArcade_trailer_cover.png", "id": "1061070172992027", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604282317_1061070176325360_7984314788343204879_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_h_LGihYXy4Q7kNvwH-ybVi&_nc_oc=Ado4zgAj3pwmj_hog8aWD2j_Z00q0olfQ812mUEcXUXbAwNIy2WsYo53o0wmSZVGrmE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGdpHlpFgSXioIuOru98pDU4LOuawOSeKHLInnTCGJqbg&oe=6A941F13"}, "display_name": "Axe Arcade", "keywords": ["axe", "throwing", "arcade", "bullseye", "casual"], "long_description": "**How good is your throw?**\n\nPick up an axe with a natural grip, feel its weight as you wind up, and send it spinning end-over-end into the board. Every throw is pure physics and timing \u2014 nail the bullseye for the big score and chase a higher total round after round.\n\n## What you do\n- Grab the axe anywhere on the handle \u2014 grip button, either hand.\n- Wind up and release with a real throwing motion; the axe flies the way you throw it.\n- Hit the target board \u2014 the closer to the bullseye, the bigger the score.\n- Ten throws a round. Beat your high score.\n\n## Pick your challenge\n- Four difficulty tiers: EASY, NORMAL, VIKING and BERSERKER.\n- Two venues to throw in \u2014 the Training Field and Fjord Lane.\n- Fjord Lane adds a distance ladder: land a scoring hit and the board steps farther away.\n- Leaderboards for your best rounds.\n\n## Built for comfort\n- Play seated or standing \u2014 everything is within arm's reach.\n- No artificial movement, no smooth turning, no vection. Comfortable rating.\n- Simple to learn, satisfying to master.", "short_description": "Grab an axe, wind up, and let it fly \u2014 sink bullseyes and climb the high-sco